    "name": "Software CEO",
    "steam_appid": 3718620,
    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Software CEO</strong> is a relaxing yet deep business simulation game where you create and manage your own software company from scratch.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Start your journey in a humble garage with a single desk and an old CRT monitor. As an ambitious founder, you\u2019ll take charge of every aspect of your growing startup: producing software, hiring employees, furnishing your office, and managing deadlines, bugs, budgets, and burnout.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3718620/extras/3f3dee167864f24f55e859f65b751e63.poster.avif?t=1749196279\" width=800 height=224 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3718620/extras/3f3dee167864f24f55e859f65b751e63.webm?t=1749196279\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3718620/extras/3f3dee167864f24f55e859f65b751e63.mp4?t=1749196279\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >At the heart of the game lies a unique component-based development system. Every software product, feature, or module is built from multiple layers of components, across five tiers of complexity. To create higher-tier components, you'll need to produce \u2014 or delegate \u2014 all the underlying elements. Good planning, skilled staff, and smart investments are key to success.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3718620/extras/7ec140b1a64bdfe621215a1f24e3fa16.poster.avif?t=1749196279\" width=800 height=224 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3718620/extras/7ec140b1a64bdfe621215a1f24e3fa16.webm?t=1749196279\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3718620/extras/7ec140b1a64bdfe621215a1f24e3fa16.mp4?t=1749196279\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can focus your business on three different types of production:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>SaaS platforms</strong> \u2013 Launch and operate live online services (e.g., marketplaces, social networks, MMORPGs) and generate revenue through subscriptions or advertising.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Traditional software</strong> \u2013 Design and release standalone products for sale, from image editors to video games.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Contract work</strong> \u2013 Deliver specific components for other companies under tight deadlines to earn reliable income.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3718620/extras/b87a85a94303e0882e3823b7b9e33f8f.poster.avif?t=1749196279\" width=800 height=224 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3718620/extras/b87a85a94303e0882e3823b7b9e33f8f.webm?t=1749196279\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3718620/extras/b87a85a94303e0882e3823b7b9e33f8f.mp4?t=1749196279\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As your company grows, so do the challenges. You\u2019ll have to:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Recruit and train employees with different specialties.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Maintain product quality while dealing with bugs and technical debt.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Manage team morale, burnout, and workplace needs.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Respond to market trends and cybersecurity threats.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3718620/extras/868c3001eccc07f680ca1d3e97b30bb3.poster.avif?t=1749196279\" width=800 height=224 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3718620/extras/868c3001eccc07f680ca1d3e97b30bb3.webm?t=1749196279\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3718620/extras/868c3001eccc07f680ca1d3e97b30bb3.mp4?t=1749196279\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The better your setup, the more efficient your team. Buy and upgrade computers, chairs, and desks. Customize your workspace with stylish decor to boost productivity or simply impress your investors. You can rent or buy bigger offices, moving from tiny startup spaces to multi-floor buildings as your empire grows.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3718620/extras/198dfb36be6472e0e3595f12608d76f1.poster.avif?t=1749196279\" width=800 height=224 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3718620/extras/198dfb36be6472e0e3595f12608d76f1.webm?t=1749196279\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3718620/extras/198dfb36be6472e0e3595f12608d76f1.mp4?t=1749196279\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Whether you're a micromanager who loves optimizing production pipelines, or a chill player who enjoys growing a cozy business at your own pace, <i>Software CEO</i> offers a strategic yet relaxing sandbox to build your digital empire.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Software CEO</strong> is a relaxing yet deep business simulation game where you create and manage your own software company from scratch.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Start your journey in a humble garage with a single desk and an old CRT monitor. As an ambitious founder, you\u2019ll take charge of every aspect of your growing startup: producing software, hiring employees, furnishing your office, and managing deadlines, bugs, budgets, and burnout.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3718620/extras/3f3dee167864f24f55e859f65b751e63.poster.avif?t=1749196279\" width=800 height=224 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3718620/extras/3f3dee167864f24f55e859f65b751e63.webm?t=1749196279\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3718620/extras/3f3dee167864f24f55e859f65b751e63.mp4?t=1749196279\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >At the heart of the game lies a unique component-based development system. Every software product, feature, or module is built from multiple layers of components, across five tiers of complexity. To create higher-tier components, you'll need to produce \u2014 or delegate \u2014 all the underlying elements. Good planning, skilled staff, and smart investments are key to success.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3718620/extras/7ec140b1a64bdfe621215a1f24e3fa16.poster.avif?t=1749196279\" width=800 height=224 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.co