oduct quality while dealing with bugs and technical debt.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Manage team morale, burnout, and workplace needs.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Respond to market trends and cybersecurity threats.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3718620/extras/868c3001eccc07f680ca1d3e97b30bb3.poster.avif?t=1749196279\" width=800 height=224 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3718620/extras/868c3001eccc07f680ca1d3e97b30bb3.webm?t=1749196279\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3718620/extras/868c3001eccc07f680ca1d3e97b30bb3.mp4?t=1749196279\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The better your setup, the more efficient your team. Buy and upgrade computers, chairs, and desks. Customize your workspace with stylish decor to boost productivity or simply impress your investors. You can rent or buy bigger offices, moving from tiny startup spaces to multi-floor buildings as your empire grows.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3718620/extras/198dfb36be6472e0e3595f12608d76f1.poster.avif?t=1749196279\" width=800 height=224 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3718620/extras/198dfb36be6472e0e3595f12608d76f1.webm?t=1749196279\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3718620/extras/198dfb36be6472e0e3595f12608d76f1.mp4?t=1749196279\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Whether you're a micromanager who loves optimizing production pipelines, or a chill player who enjoys growing a cozy business at your own pace, <i>Software CEO</i> offers a strategic yet relaxing sandbox to build your digital empire.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
